WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.584
In the Qin court hall, the young Second Emperor of Qin sat on his throne.

00:00:04.984 --> 00:00:08.512
The powerful official Zhao Gao led in a cute little deer.

00:00:08.912 --> 00:00:13.688
Pointing at the deer, he said: "Your Majesty, this is a horse!"

00:00:14.088 --> 00:00:17.760
The officials looked at one another, their hearts full of tension.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:23.896
Most of them feared Zhao Gao and nodded: "Yes, it is a horse."

00:00:24.296 --> 00:00:29.288
Only one brave official shook his head: "This is clearly a deer!"

00:00:29.688 --> 00:00:34.920
The young emperor did not know that Zhao Gao had noted down everyone who objected.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:39.208
The emperor looked at the deer, then at the officials, his face full of confusion.

00:00:39.608 --> 00:00:44.840
From then on, it was clear who obeyed Zhao Gao and who dared to speak the truth.

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:50.200
"Calling a deer a horse" became an idiom, describing deliberately calling wrong right.
